image_description = "Stylized fantasy card illustration, painterly digital art with clean bold shapes and soft cel-shaded lighting, whimsical and expressive young-adult tone like a modern indie RPG, rich saturated colors with a warm key light and colored shadows, a single clear focal subject with a readable silhouette, simple atmospheric background, slight exaggeration for comedy. Vertical 2:3 portrait composition for a full-art trading card: main subject in the upper-middle of the frame, fully visible, head and key details within the upper 60%; top 10% uncluttered; lower third calmer and less detailed (soft background, ground, or atmosphere) so rules text can overlay it; keep important elements away from the outer edges. No text, no letters, no card frame, no border. Sunny gold and warm red palette, gym and mill motifs, dynamic action poses. A barrel-chested hammer thrower in a sweat-stained singlet mid-spin, a sledge-sized hammer on a chain blurring in an arc above his head, gravel and chalk dust flying, a tiny terrified gym mascot ducking in the background."
